---

The chat memory implements OptChat, a design by Victor Taelin
(https://gist.github.com/VictorTaelin/91837951a5ce5b38f341ec1ba1df6449), which
grew out of his OptMem (https://github.com/VictorTaelin/OptMem). The memory's
prompts (COMPACT, MASTER, VIEW_DOC, the subagent prompt, and the zoom and date
tool descriptions) are taken from that specification, with the agent renamed.
